</math> and <math alttext="b"><mi>b</mi>
</math> are constants, the initial value of the function&mdash;that is, the value of the function when <math alttext="t equals 0"><mrow>
	<mi>t</mi>
	<mo>=</mo>
	<mn>0</mn>
</mrow>
</math>&mdash;is <math alttext="a"><mi>a</mi>
