>\n</math> and <math alttext=\"m\"><mi>m</mi>\n</math>?</p>","externalid":"6130d2b7-20eb-4881-8cfa-8ee3adb6499e","templateid":"e6e1fd4e-c0c5-4bc4-ab9d-e2f3be2ab1c1","vaultid":"74e9e7bd-b8ef-4ce3-b6e0-bd0f8612bac3","type":"mcq","answerOptions":[{"id":"a7d72f60-97d0-469b-bfa7-424d5b739709","content":"<p><math alttext=\"j equals StartFraction k Over 8 EndFraction plus 15 m\"><mi>j</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>k</mi><mrow><mn>8</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mrow><mn>15</mn></mrow><mi>m</mi></math></p>"},{"id":"a0a2bfe5-3512-4dfb-9827-899625985386","content":"<p><math alttext=\"j equals k plus StartFraction 15 m Over 8 EndFraction\"><mi>j</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mn>15</mn></mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>8</mn></mrow></mfrac></math></p>"},{"id":"3e81883a-a2b4-49fe-aa6a-c44cdc6d7ff6","content":"<p><math alttext=\"j equals 8 left parenthesis k plus 15 m right parenthesis\"><mi>j</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mn>8</mn></mrow><mo>(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mrow><mn>15</mn></mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>)</mo></math></p>"},{"id":"29ac86b6-7771-4500-9025-f7316c6e9eab","content":"<p><math alttext=\"j equals StartFraction k plus 15 m Over 8 EndFraction\"><mi>j</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mrow><mn>15</mn></mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>8</mn></mrow></mfrac></math></p>"}],"correct_answer":["D"]},"createDate":1691007959824,"updateDate":1691007959824}$SATQ$::jsonb, 1691007959824, 1691007959824),
    ($SATQ$b8caaf84$SATQ$, NULL, NULL, $SATQ$022234-DC$SATQ$, $SATQ$disclosed$SATQ$, $SATQ$SAT$SATQ$, 2, $SATQ$Math$SATQ$, $SATQ$Advanced Math$SATQ$, $SATQ$P$SATQ$, $SATQ$P.A.$SATQ$, $SATQ$Equivalent expressions$SATQ$, $SATQ$M$SATQ$, 4, $SATQ$mcq$SATQ$, NULL, $SATQ$<p class="stem_paragraph ">If <span class="math_expression "><span class="math-container"><img align="middle" role="math" class="math-img" src="https://bkmyfcolrdumyrwktjrr.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/sat-images/b8caaf84/img_004_4d120cca.png" alt="p equals, 3 x, plus 4 "></span></span> and <span class="math_expression "><span class="math-container"><img align="middle" role="math" class="math-img" src="https://bkmyfcolrdumyrwktjrr.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/sat-images/b8caaf84/img_005_7ec5678f.png" alt="v equals, x plus 5"></span></span>, which of the following is equivalent to <span class="math_expression "><span class="math-container"><img align="middle" role="math" class="math-img" src="https://bkmyfcolrdumyrwktjrr.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/sat-images/b8caaf84/img_006_f1143538.png" alt="p v, minus 2 p, plus v"></span></span> ?</p>
$SATQ$, $SATQ$[{"id":"a","content":"<p class=\"choice_paragraph \"><span class=\"math_expression \"><span class=\"math-container\"><img align=\"middle\" role=\"math\" class=\"math-img\" src=\"https://bkmyfcolrdumyrwktjrr.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/sat-images/b8caaf84/img_000_ab0ba143.png\" alt=\"3 x squared, plus, 12 x, plus 7\"></span></span></p>\n"},{"id":"b","content":"<p class=\"choice_paragraph \"><span class=\"math_expression \"><span class=\"math-container\"><img align=\"middle\" role=\"math\" class=\"math-img\" src=\"https://bkmyfcolrdumyrwktjrr.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/sat-images/b8caaf84/img_001_d38d7b55.png\" alt=\"3 x squared, plus, 14 x, plus 17\"></span></span></p>\n"},{"id":"c","content":"<p class=\"choice_paragraph \"><span class=\"math_expression \"><span class=\"math-container\"><img align=\"middle\" role=\"math\" class=\"math-img\" src=\"https://bkmyfcolrdumyrwktjrr.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/sat-images/b8caaf84/img_002_8390d18c.png\" alt=\"3 x squared, plus, 19 x, plus 20\"></span></span></p>\n"},{"id":"d","content":"<p class=\"choice_paragraph \"><span class=\"math_expression \"><span class=\"math-container\"><img align=\"middle\" role=\"math\" class=\"math-img\" src=\"https://bkmyfcolrdumyrwktjrr.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/sat-images/b8caaf84/img_003_05c17357.png\" alt=\"3 x squared, plus, 26 x, plus 33\"></span></span></p>\n"}]$SATQ$::jsonb, $SATQ$["B"]$SATQ$::jsonb, NULL, $SATQ$<p>Choice B is correct. It&rsquo;s given that <span class="math-container"><img align="middle" role="math" class="math-img" src="https://bkmyfcolrdumyrwktjrr.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/sat-images/b8caaf84/img_007_4d120cca.png" alt="p equals, 3 x plus 4 "></span> and <span class="math-container"><img align="middle" role="math" class="math-img" src="https://bkmyfcolrdumyrwktjrr.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/sat-images/b8caaf84/img_008_7ec5678f.png" alt="v equals, x plus 5"></span>. Substituting the values for <span class="italic">p</span> and <span class="italic">v</span> into the expression <span class="math-container"><img align="middle" role="math" class="math-img" src="https://bkmyfcolrdumyrwktjrr.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/sat-images/b8caaf84/img_009_f1143538.png" alt="p v, minus 2 p, plus v "></span> yields <span class="math-container"><img align="middle" role="math" class="math-img" src="https://bkmyfcolrdumyrwktjrr.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/sat-images/b8caaf84/img_010_b7c58f6b.png" alt="open parenthesis, 3 x plus 4, close parenthesis, times, open parenthesis, x plus 5, close parenthesis, minus, 2 times, open parenthesis, 3 x plus 4, close parenthesis, plus x, plus 5"></span>. Multiplying the terms <span class="math-container"><img align="middle" role="math" class="math-img" src="https://bkmyfcolrdumyrwktjrr.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/sat-images/b8caaf84/img_011_ba0c9691.png" alt="open parenthesis, 3 x plus 4, close parenthesis, times, open parenthesis, x plus 5, close parenthesis"></span> yields <span class="math-container"><img align="middle" role="math" class="math-img" src="https://bkmyfcolrdumyrwktjrr.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/sat-images/b8caaf84/img_012_b106f2df.png" alt="3 x squared, plus 4 x, plus 15 x, plus 20"></span>. Using the distributive property to rewrite <span class="math-container"><img align="middle" role="math" class="math-img" src="https://bkmyfcolrdumyrwktjrr.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/sat-images/b8caaf84/img_013_8ba636b1.png" alt="negative 2 times, open parenthesis, 3 x plus 4, close parenthesis"></span> yields <span class="math-container"><img align="middle" role="math" class="math-img" src="https://bkmyfcolrdumyrwktjrr.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/sat-images/b8caaf84/img_014_27823f2a.png" alt="negative 6 x minus 8"></span>. Therefore, the entire expression can be represented as <span class="math-container"><img align="middle" role="math" class="math-img" src="https://bkmyfcolrdumyrwk