</math> is a factor of each term in the given expression, the expression is equivalent to <math alttext="x left parenthesis 9 x right parenthesis plus x left parenthesis 5 right parenthesis"><mi>x</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>9</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mfenced><mn>5</mn></mfenced></math>, or&nbsp;<math alttext="x left parenthesis 9 x plus 5 right parenthesis"><mi>x</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>9</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>.</p>
<p style="text-align: left;">Choice B is incorrect. This expression is equivalent to <math alttext="45 x squared plus 5 x"><mrow>
	<mrow>
		<mn>45</mn>
		<msup>
			<mi>x</mi>
			<mn>2</mn>
		</msup>
	</mrow>
	<mo>+</mo>
	<mrow>
		<mn>5</mn>
		<mi>x</mi>
	</mrow>
</mrow>
</math>, not <math alttext="9 x squared plus 5 x"><mrow>
	<mrow>
		<mn>9</mn>
		<msup>
			<mi>x</mi>
			<mn>2</mn>
		</msup>
	</mrow>
	<mo>+</mo>
	<mrow>
		<mn>5</mn>
		<mi>x</mi>
	</mrow>
</mrow>
</math>.</p>
<p style="text-align: left;">Choice C is incorrect. This expression is equivalent to <math alttext="9 x squared plus 45 x"><mrow>
	<mrow>
		<mn>9</mn>
		<msup>
			<mi>x</mi>
			<mn>2</mn>
		</msup>
	</mrow>
	<mo>+</mo>
	<mrow>
		<mn>45</mn>
		<mi>x</mi>
	</mrow>
</mrow>
</math>, not <math alttext="9 x squared plus 5 x"><mrow>
	<mrow>
		<mn>9</mn>
		<msup>
			<mi>x</mi>
			<mn>2</mn>
		</msup>
	</mrow>
	<mo>+</mo>
	<mrow>
		<mn>5</mn>
		<mi>x</mi>
	</mrow>
</mrow>
</math>.</p>
<p style="text-align: left;">Choice D is incorrect. This expression is equivalent to <math alttext="9 x cubed plus 5 x squared"><mrow>
	<mrow>
		<mn>9</mn>
		<msup>
			<mi>x</mi>
			<mn>3</mn>
		</msup>
	</mrow>
	<mo>+</mo>
	<mrow>
		<mn>5</mn>
		<msup>
			<mi>x</mi>
			<mn>2</mn>
		</msup>
	</mrow>
</mrow>
</math>, not <math alttext="9 x squared plus 5 x"><mrow>
	<mrow>
		<mn>9</mn>
		<msup>
			<mi>x</mi>
			<mn>2</mn>
		</msup>
	</mrow>
	<mo>+</mo>
	<mrow>
		<mn>5</mn>
		<mi>x</mi>
	</mrow>
</mrow>
