</math> is defined by&nbsp;<math alttext="f left parenthesis x right parenthesis equals x squared plus x plus 71"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mrow><mn>71</mn></mrow></math>. What is the value of&nbsp;<math alttext="f left parenthesis 2 right parenthesis"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math>?</p>$SATQ$, $SATQ$[]$SATQ$::jsonb, $SATQ$["77"]$SATQ$::jsonb, $SATQ$["77"]$SATQ$::jsonb, $SATQ$<p style="text-align: left;">The correct answer is <math alttext="77"><mn>77</mn>
</math>. It&rsquo;s given that the function <math alttext="f"><mi>f</mi>
</math> is defined by&nbsp;<math alttext="f left parenthesis x right parenthesis equals x squared plus x plus 71"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>71</mn></math>. Substituting <math alttext="2"><mn>2</mn>
</math> for <math alttext="x"><mi>x</mi>
