<p style="text-align: left;">The given equation relates the variables <math alttext="p"><mi>p</mi>
</math>, <math alttext="q"><mi>q</mi>
</math>, and <math alttext="r"><mi>r</mi>
</math>. Which equation correctly expresses <math alttext="p"><mi>p</mi>
