</math> and <math alttext="r"><mi>r</mi>
</math>?&nbsp;</p>$SATQ$, $SATQ$[{"id":"5e956bc9-ce3b-4278-a178-f944a38f61c2","content":"<p><math alttext=\"p equals q plus r plus 34\"><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>q</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>+</mo><mrow><mn>34</mn></mrow></math></p>"},{"id":"6ba1adbe-125f-421c-83f4-1879938b3a48","content":"<p><math alttext=\"p equals q plus r minus 34\"><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>q</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>-</mo><mrow><mn>34</mn></mrow></math></p>"},{"id":"4067997a-6c26-41b0-9058-8f424cbdc9b2","content":"<p><math alttext=\"p equals negative q minus r plus 34\"><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>q</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>+</mo><mrow><mn>34</mn></mrow></math></p>"},{"id":"f2f2c8b2-32cc-447e-b2b0-e7e626fc6888","content":"<p><math alttext=\"p equals negative q minus r minus 34\"><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>q</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>-</mo><mrow><mn>34</mn></mrow></math></p>"}]$SATQ$::jsonb, $SATQ$["B"]$SATQ$::jsonb, $SATQ$["6ba1adbe-125f-421c-83f4-1879938b3a48"]$SATQ$::jsonb, $SATQ$<p>Choice B is correct. Subtracting <math alttext="34"><mn>34</mn>
</math> from each side of the given equation yields <math alttext="p equals q plus r minus 34"><mrow>
	<mi>p</mi>
	<mo>=</mo>
	<mrow>
		<mi>q</mi>
		<mo>+</mo>
		<mi>r</mi>
		<mo>-</mo>
		<mn>34</mn>
	</mrow>
</mrow>
</math>. Thus, the equation <math alttext="p equals q plus r minus 34"><mrow>
	<mi>p</mi>
	<mo>=</mo>
	<mrow>
		<mi>q</mi>
		<mo>+</mo>
		<mi>r</mi>
		<mo>-</mo>
		<mn>34</mn>
	</mrow>
</mrow>
</math> correctly expresses <math alttext="p"><mi>p</mi>
</math> in terms of <math alttext="q"><mi>q</mi>
</math> and <math alttext="r"><mi>r</mi>
</math>.</p>
<p style="text-align: left;">Choice A is incorrect. This equation can be rewritten as <math alttext="p minus 34 equals q plus r"><mrow>
	<mrow>
		<mi>p</mi>
		<mo>-</mo>
		<mn>34</mn>
	</mrow>
	<mo>=</mo>
	<mrow>
		<mi>q</mi>
		<mo>+</mo>
		<mi>r</mi>
	</mrow>
</mrow>
</math>.</p>
<p style="text-align: left;">Choice C is incorrect. This equation can be rewritten as <math alttext="p minus 34 equals negative q minus r"><mrow>
