			<mi>q</mi>
		</mrow>
		<mo>-</mo>
		<mi>r</mi>
	</mrow>
</mrow>
</math>.</p>
<p style="text-align: left;">Choice D is incorrect. This equation can be rewritten as <math alttext="p plus 34 equals negative q minus r"><mrow>
