</math> seconds after it is thrown. If follows that the height, in meters, from which the egg was thrown is the value of <math alttext="h"><mi>h</mi>
</math> when <math alttext="t equals 0"><mrow>
	<mi>t</mi>
	<mo>=</mo>
	<mn>0</mn>
</mrow>
